        "Description": "good morning, 47.\rYou&apos;re targets are: Alicia Laurie, James Burton and Tiffaney Prout.\rAlicia was a lawyer from Massachusetts, but she moved to Vermont because she was escaping a crime she and her teammates did.\rShe burned down the house of her client: Mia Prout, and stoled her diary selled it.\rWith the help of James and Tiffaney they did all of that and stoled evidence from the counthouse, Mia was arrested because of it.\rJudge Parry wants you to take care of them.\rGood luck, 47.",
